THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

WST WiFi Speed Test uses third-party services for diagnostics, advertising
and purchase functionality:

  • Cloudflare and public LibreSpeed endpoint operators
    Network measurements. Subject to the respective providers' terms.
    Some manually selectable legacy HTTP endpoints are also available.

  • RevenueCat (https://www.revenuecat.com/)
    Subscription and purchase management.

  • Google Play Billing
    Payment processing. Subject to Google's terms of service.

  • Google AdMob (https://admob.google.com/)
    Advertising SDK and UMP consent controls. Subject to Google's terms.
    Enabled when no valid Supporter ad-removal entitlement applies and
    consent status permits requests. Premium Lifetime does not remove ads.

Third-party libraries and open-source components retain their respective
licenses; this License does not override those rights. The Author's own
application code, branding and materials remain proprietary.

